---
// ProLog case hero: the log stream from the prolog.ag hero (decorative lines scrolling up in
// small bursts, as the site's code background does), with the ProLog logo on top. No
// spotlight or custom cursor. Fills the article width at 16:9, with the height capped so it fits
// a desktop screen; 4:5 on phones. Paused off screen; still with reduced motion.
---

<div class="pl-hero-wrap">
<figure class="pl-hero" data-pl-hero>
  <div class="pl-hero__stream" aria-hidden="true"><div class="pl-hero__lines" data-pl-lines></div></div>
  <img
    class="pl-hero__logo"
    src="/assets/cases/prolog/prolog-lockup.svg"
    alt="ProLog, IT security made in Germany"
    width="720"
    height="211"
  />
</figure>
</div>

